      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Divert Thoughts",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger Kirosthrek attempts a saving throw against a spell\n\n---\n\nEffect Kirosthrek diverts some of the spell's energy, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to the saving throw or +4 if the spell has the mental trait.\n\nIf she critically succeeds at the saving throw, she can use the Cast a Spell action on her next turn to cast the triggering spell at the same level without expending any spell slots.",
