            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Consume Knowledge",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "mental",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Kirosthrek invades the mind of a creature within 100 feet and attempts to swallow its capacity for higher thought. The creature must attempt a DC 42 Will save save.\n\nUsing Consume Knowledge immediately ends any of the ability's previous effects on a different creature.\n\n---\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature is Slowed 1 for 1 round.\n\nFailure The creature is slowed 1 and can take no actions other than basic actions for 1 minute.\n\nCritical Failure As failure, and Kirosthrek is Quickened for 1 minute. She can use this extra action to Stride, Strike, or Cast a Spell if the target had prepared spells or a spell repertoire."
    },
